# Dependencies / build output
node_modules/
design-system/storybook-static/

# Machine-local agent settings (absolute paths, per-user permission allowlist).
# .claude/launch.json IS committed — it is the shared dev-server config.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Transient git worktrees used to run build phases in parallel. These are whole
# checkouts of this repo; committing them would nest the repo inside itself.
.claude/worktrees/

# Vercel CLI project linkage — machine-local, and it is not gitignored by default.
.vercel/

# Private reference material — the complex design system this one simplifies.
# Contains employer-internal configs; never publish.
generated/
generated.zip

# Audit findings. Deliberately NOT committed, and this entry is the enforcement
# rather than a note asking someone to remember. They carry working reproduction
# steps against this deployment — the /api/mcp amplification, the prototype-chain
# probes, and a constructed answer that passes all three hallucination gates — so
# publishing them arms an attacker faster than it informs a reader. The audit
# PROMPTS (01-*.md, 02-*.md, 03-*.md) stay tracked; only the findings are private.
# .vercelignore separately keeps all of docs/ off the deployed site.
docs/audits/*.findings.md
docs/audits/*-findings.md
docs/audits/04-ai-readable-design-system.md
docs/audits/05-ai-engineering-findings.md

# Environment & noise
.env
.env.*
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vercel
.env*
